=1748592024"}],"short_description":"Survive in a constantly changing maze, explore, and uncover the hidden secrets of this world. Your final choice will determine the ending.","steam_appid":3617130,"support_info":{"email":"hyungameworld@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}